#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge4/scripts.inc:24
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge4_Text_NeedBreatherAfterBattles"
msgid ""
"Whew…\p"
"I need to take a breather after\n"
"some intense battles…\p"
"But even now, I never take a break\n"
"from plotting strategy and combos.$"
msgstr ""
"呼……\p"
"经过几场激烈的对战，\n"
"我得喘口气了……\p"
"不过就算是现在，我也一刻不停地\n"
"在构思战术和组合。$"
